{"title":"2010 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/8/1a863a14f59428d47ca0311b0d9a3280a23f9504.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 + 4 \\div 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/2/702c3473a41d6c73fbbf4a9c188ea0c864850bf4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 5 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 6 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 7 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 8 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"388\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Following <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">order of operations</a>, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/2/1a280a62c70ece000d8a3e40f01e5341262a3575.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 + 4 \\div 2 = 6 + 2 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"219\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"2010 CEMC Cayley\">2010 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2010 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 CEMC Cayley Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2010 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2010 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2010 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2010 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2010 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2010 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2010 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 9 (pag